<p>UMPA's filing names no customers, but it sets a ceiling. City staff called Hydro the city's largest single power user, at about 4 MW,<a class="fnref" href="#fs60"><sup>51</sup></a> and it and Mountain Country Foods almost certainly sit in the five-account Large Commercial class, which uses <strong>48.02 GWh a year in total</strong>, so no one plant in it uses more than 48 GWh a year.<a class="fnref" href="#fs7"><sup>5</sup></a><a class="fnref" id="rs51" href="#fs51"><sup>35</sup></a></p>
