<tr><td><strong>Currently on the market</strong></td><td>Up to 451,792 sq ft: two warehouse spaces of 208,599 and 196,249 sq ft plus 46,944 sq ft of office</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Loading</strong></td><td>36 dock-high doors, as listed for the space on the market; the flyer's bullets list one grade-level door and its specification table three. The applicant told the Council on 04 AUG the building has 36 loading bays, and on 01 SEP put its built purpose at 85 bays <code>UPDATED</code> <a class="fnref" href="#fs64"><sup>55</sup></a><a class="fnref" href="#fs60"><sup>51</sup></a><a class="fnref" href="#fs91"><sup>77</sup></a></td></tr>
