  <li><strong>Water:</strong> 250,000 gal/yr is the applicant's annual cooling and humidification make-up, after a one-time fill of about 500,000 gal; its whole-site figure is 1 to 3 million, a 40 to 80% reduction; household size is 3.59, not 3.39 (§1, §4, §6, §12, §17).</li>
